<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">November in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">279 events on the 30 days of November, from 571 BCE to 2015: the best known of them, the people born and died in the month, its festivals and its songs.</p></header>
